        about_frame_limit: "The most frames that are drawn a second. The fight runs at {ticks} ticks a second, so that is as low as it goes.",
        about_performance: "# Minimal\nRenders just the framerate as well as CPU & GPU frametimes.\n\n# Full\nShows all tracked/labelled objects the engine is working on in a scene currently.",
