        about_ui_skin: "The skin used to render the menus and the HUD.",
        about_ui_theme: "The rendered theme of the UI skin, **not all skins have multiple themes.**",
        about_transitions: "How one screen hands over to the next. Mixed melts the menus into each other and rots a fight in and out.",
        about_crt: "Draws the game like it is on a crusty old picture tube, the way god intended pixel art to be shown.",
        about_bloom: "A soft glow around light emitters like the lanterns and whatever else shines in a fight.",
        about_pathtraced: "Path tracing calculates multiple summed irradiance passes over the scenes light emitters, the result is that light bounces off the arena and its sprites. Wants a proper GPU.",
        about_light_quality: "How finely the pathtraced light is worked out. Low costs about half of High, the light around smaller lamps shimmer a touch more.\n\nMedium looks perfect, high _is_ pixel perfect.",
